    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"quiet\" sounds more like nothingness. honestly, it’s just exhausting. i look at the world and it’s like i’m watching a movie in a language i don’t speak anymore. everyone is moving, building, creating... and i’m just stuck in this stillness. what’s the point of even trying to find the spark again? if the art is gone, what’s actually left of me?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
